### 1. GET Semua Produk
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 2. GET Detail Produk by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 3. POST Tambah Produk 1 (Kopi)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Gayo Arabika",
  "description": "Biji kopi sangrai premium 250g",
  "price": 85000.0,
  "stock": 50,
  "category": "Minuman"
}

### 4. POST Tambah Produk 2 (Sepatu)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sepatu Lari Nike Pegasus",
  "description": "Ukuran 42 warna hitam sporty",
  "price": 850000.0,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "Sepatu"
}

### 5. POST Tambah Produk 3 (Keyboard)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard RGB",
  "description": "Switch Biru, Layout 75% tactile",
  "price": 450000.0,
  "stock": 20,
  "category": "Elektronik"
}

### 6. Cari Produk Berdasarkan Nama (Search Keyword "kopi" atau "nike")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?name=kopi

### 7. Filter Produk Berdasarkan Kategori (Category "Elektronik" atau "Minuman")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/category/Minuman

### 8. PUT Update Produk by ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Gayo Arabika Special Blend",
  "description": "Promo diskon akhir pekan!",
  "price": 75000.0,
  "stock": 100,
  "category": "Minuman"
}

### 9. DELETE Produk by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/2
